{"id":"vod_sn_36518","vodId":"36518","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"小女神花铃","name_cn":"小女神花铃","date":"2007-01-01","year":"2007","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/eb4939a2ec3a241a750e73afd2341f3c.jpg"},"summary":"花园花铃（中原麻衣 配音）拥有着悲惨的身世，在她尚且没有记忆的时候，父母就过世了。之后，叔母收留了无处可去的花铃。花铃虽然个性善良而又温柔，脑袋却有些笨笨的，无论是成绩也好运动也好人际交往也好，她都慢别人一步，因此常常遭到叔母的责骂。花铃唯一的好朋友是她的宠物猫小西，然而有一天，小西也离她而去。　　一次偶然中，花铃发现了母亲留下来的一枚戒指，这枚戒指拥有神奇的法力，能够让花铃变身成为魔法少女。之后，花铃又遇见了九条姬香（下屋则子 配音）和九条和音（泽城美雪 配音），他们也拥有着各自的戒指。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:43:50","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uTXYTTNVvS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9MBfwqHrU81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/PPRTia2H4F1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rTFhzUJwTa1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jE5HEBQ5Gu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4VKhz3NBJb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JiqYkGPYvN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pbxksXCiVH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YrbzLNrGq81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0UJ6kUQDww1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ACPUBd6PFh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9jwQys4PLj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DPQ8bGPQ5c1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jberW5kZrS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/